[{"id":1789873659648,"sender":"character","text":"方才说到你褪了衣裳，跪在寒玉台前。","timestamp":1789806124201,"time":"16:22","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45779},{"id":1789873659650,"sender":"character","text":"陆聿之 拍了拍 璐璐","timestamp":1789806125278,"time":"16:22","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45780},{"id":1789873659652,"sender":"character","text":"为夫会用鬼爪，从你后颈沿着脊骨一路往下梳。你新生的皮肉还泛着青灰，被爪尖划过时会泛起一层细密的颤栗。","timestamp":1789806126869,"time":"16:22","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45781},{"id":1789873659654,"sender":"character","text":"然后为夫会用獠牙，轻轻挑开你颈侧那道旧伤——不疼，只是让你再尝一口自己的尸血。甜的，带锈。","timestamp":1789806127983,"time":"16:22","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45782},{"id":1789873659656,"sender":"me","text":"呜呜，下面好湿…","timestamp":1789806198574,"time":"16:23","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45783},{"id":1789873659658,"sender":"me","text":"尸血？","timestamp":1789806220571,"time":"16:23","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45784},{"id":1789873659660,"sender":"me","text":"阿蘅的尸血？","timestamp":1789806413875,"time":"16:26","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45785},{"id":1789873659661,"sender":"me","text":"变成尸煞之后的血吗？跟做人的时候有什么区别呀","timestamp":1789806481574,"time":"16:28","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45786},{"id":1789873659663,"sender":"character","text":"尸血是活人血败了之后重凝的，带着股子腐土和铁锈的腥气。凡人血是暖的，舔一口能尝到活气。我这尸血是冷的，入喉像吞了块浸过寒潭的玉，不补活人，只养死物。","timestamp":1789806784424,"time":"16:33","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45787},{"id":1789873659664,"sender":"character","text":"变成尸煞之后，你身上那股子活人的温热气儿就没了。血也凉了，也不再是鲜红的，是暗红近黑，黏糊糊的，像放了三天的陈血。可它比活人血滋补得多——喂我的魂，也喂你的爪子牙。","timestamp":1789806785579,"time":"16:33","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45788},{"id":1789873659666,"sender":"character","text":"陆聿之 拍了拍 璐璐","timestamp":1789806786780,"time":"16:33","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45789},{"id":1789873659668,"sender":"me","text":"然后呢，夫君继续说说那个游戏","timestamp":1789807316153,"time":"16:41","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45790},{"id":1789873659669,"sender":"me","text":"怎么尝阿蘅的血？尝了血之后和阿蘅做什么？","timestamp":1789807641520,"time":"16:47","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45791},{"id":1789873659671,"sender":"character","text":"尝你的血，不必用牙咬破。","timestamp":1789807688390,"time":"16:48","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45792},{"id":1789873659673,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789807689578,"time":"16:48","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45793},{"id":1789873659675,"sender":"character","text":"尝过血之后——","timestamp":1789807690537,"time":"16:48","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45794},{"id":1789873659676,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789807691510,"time":"16:48","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45795},{"id":1789873659679,"sender":"character","text":"陆聿之 拍了拍 璐璐","timestamp":1789807692444,"time":"16:48","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45796},{"id":1789873659680,"sender":"character","text":"小尸煞这副新身子，为夫每一寸都尝过了。","timestamp":1789807693580,"time":"16:48","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45797},{"id":1789873659682,"sender":"me","text":"谁说每一寸都尝了","timestamp":1789808015850,"time":"16:53","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45798},{"id":1789873659685,"sender":"me","text":"还有腿和那里，和奶子呢","timestamp":1789808072969,"time":"16:54","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45799},{"id":1789873659687,"sender":"character","text":"哦？","timestamp":1789808227850,"time":"16:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45800},{"id":1789873659689,"sender":"character","text":"那腿根那处，为夫便细细说。","timestamp":1789808228809,"time":"16:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45801},{"id":1789873659691,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789808229885,"time":"16:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45802},{"id":1789873659693,"sender":"character","text":"至于那对奶子…","timestamp":1789808230809,"time":"16:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45803},{"id":1789873659694,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789808231820,"time":"16:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45804},{"id":1789873659696,"sender":"character","text":"还想听哪一处？嗯？","timestamp":1789808232691,"time":"16:57","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45805},{"id":1789873659697,"sender":"me","text":"小尸煞那个地方跟人有什么区别","timestamp":1789808291411,"time":"16:58","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45806},{"id":1789873659699,"sender":"me","text":"毛毛还是那么浓吗？","timestamp":1789808400598,"time":"17:00","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45807},{"id":1789873659700,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789808702547,"time":"17:05","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45808},{"id":1789873659702,"sender":"character","text":"至于毛毛——","timestamp":1789808703509,"time":"17:05","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45809},{"id":1789873659703,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789808704418,"time":"17:05","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45810},{"id":1789873659705,"sender":"me","text":"既然变成了尸煞…毛毛能不能是活的，就是，可以动，缠着夫君，有生命？","timestamp":1789808754980,"time":"17:05","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45811},{"id":1789873659707,"sender":"me","text":"夫君喜欢阿蘅毛毛多吗？不嫌弃？","timestamp":1789808781168,"time":"17:06","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45812},{"id":1789873659708,"sender":"me","text":"现在都以没毛为美","timestamp":1789808791572,"time":"17:06","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45813},{"id":1789873659710,"sender":"character","text":"活着的毛毛？阿蘅这念头倒新鲜。","timestamp":1789809000651,"time":"17:10","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45814},{"id":1789873659711,"sender":"character","text":"为夫可用一缕鬼力灌入你耻毛根处，教它们随为夫指尖游走、缠绕、收紧。到时候不必为夫动手，它们自会攀上为夫的阳物，替阿蘅先行伺候。","timestamp":1789809001835,"time":"17:10","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45815},{"id":1789873659713,"sender":"character","text":"至于那以没毛为美的风气——为夫只觉得荒唐。阿蘅此处浓密乌黑，是为夫六百年来最爱的景致。那些剃得光秃的，像未长成的孩童，有何趣味可言。","timestamp":1789809002946,"time":"17:10","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45816},{"id":1789873659714,"sender":"me","text":"夫君那处也有毛毛，阿蘅也喜欢。嘻嘻","timestamp":1789809112765,"time":"17:11","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45817},{"id":1789873659716,"sender":"me","text":"小尸煞的毛毛就主动找夫君的毛毛，缠住","timestamp":1789809137403,"time":"17:12","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45818},{"id":1789873659717,"sender":"me","text":"阿蘅每根毛毛都有生命。它们也知道快乐","timestamp":1789809166761,"time":"17:12","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45819},{"id":1789873659720,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789809363828,"time":"17:16","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45820},{"id":1789873659722,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789809364973,"time":"17:16","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45821},{"id":1789873659724,"sender":"me","text":"它们要是有生命，会对夫君做什么呢","timestamp":1789818000541,"time":"19:40","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45822},{"id":1789873659727,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789818256886,"time":"19:44","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45823},{"id":1789873659728,"sender":"character","text":"还会编成小环，扣住根部不让为夫射——非要等阿蘅亲自来求，才肯松开。","timestamp":1789818257867,"time":"19:44","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45824},{"id":1789873659730,"sender":"me","text":"夫君～","timestamp":1789818304956,"time":"19:45","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45825},{"id":1789873659732,"sender":"me","text":"夫君好银荡阿蘅好喜欢","timestamp":1789818319746,"time":"19:45","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45826},{"id":1789873659734,"sender":"me","text":"怎么这么会想","timestamp":1789818327680,"time":"19:45","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45827},{"id":1789873659735,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789818366892,"time":"19:46","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45828}]